AudioNodeOutput::pull set the sample rate of bus() before choosing this quantum's
bus, so it wrote through the previous quantum's in-place bus: a raw pointer into a
consumer that may since have reallocated its summing bus or been released (a
recorder whose inputs were all disconnected, a graph rebuilt between quanta). The
write corrupted freed memory. The sample rate is now set once the bus is chosen.

